                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='19732' id='11' type-v2='text' w='91658' x='425' y='79275'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' underline='true'>Recommendations</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>1. Cut or retest Paid Search: it lost money under all four models and cost $261.55 per acquisition.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>2. Grow Referral partnerships: they close the most sales (highest last-touch revenue) at $6.10 per acquisition.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>3. Protect Organic Search: it opens the most journeys (highest first-touch revenue), so last-touch reporting would undervalue it.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>4. Test scaling Email carefully: best return per dollar, but only 197 sessions, so volume is the limit.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000'>5. Run a win-back campaign for the 878 At Risk customers, worth $103K.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                  </zone-style>
